<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>Open 1.3.7 专用版</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>通知悬浮气泡 · 0.48.33 · Open 1.3.7 专用版</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>适配 Open 定制版 1.3.7。分屏保留常用容器和最近 3 个后台 App；绿色按钮执行顶部绿色区域长按动作，关闭按钮执行右侧橙色区域单击动作。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用悬浮气泡</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>显示位置</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>竖屏窗口贴合左下角时显示分屏图标，离开后隐藏，返回后恢复。仅在分屏图标实际显示时隐藏 Open 边缘图标。场景切换后默认展开，App 全屏时默认收起；随后可自由手动控制。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>锁屏显示</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowOnLock</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>主屏显示</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowOnHome</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>App 内显示</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ShowInApps</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>图标外观</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>大小范围 32–80 点，默认 48 点；不透明度范围 20%–100%，越低越透明。修改即时生效。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>图标大小</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>IconSize</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>48</integer>
			<key>min</key>
			<integer>32</integer>
			<key>max</key>
			<integer>80</integer>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>图标不透明度</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>IconOpacity</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<real>1.0</real>
			<key>min</key>
			<real>0.2</real>
			<key>max</key>
			<real>1.0</real>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>气泡与角标</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>单击分屏图标执行打开操作，长按清除图标及对应 App；常用容器支持长按调整顺序。不使用双击。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>清除全部气泡</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>clearBubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>分屏切换</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>开启后，只关闭上一个仍展开的竖屏分屏窗口，不终止 App 后台。左上角、右上角小窗及横屏窗口均保留；状态无法确认时也保留。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>切换时关闭上一个竖屏窗口</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ClosePreviousSplit</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>排列规则</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>分屏常用容器在上，最近 3 个后台 App 在下，同一个 App 不重复显示。上下各留分屏高度 5%，常用容器可滚动查看。键盘弹出时缩短容器。关闭按钮在容器下方，横屏功能按钮仍保留。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>分屏与截屏</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>冻屏仅在桌面背景且存在展开的竖屏窗口时生效；横竖屏并存时仍冻结，只有横屏、小窗或背景为全屏 App 时不冻结。模糊透明度越高，桌面越清晰；100% 完全透明但仍防误触。截屏隐藏全部气泡、角标、容器及清理按钮，不隐藏分屏 App，可能同时影响录屏。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>分屏时冻结桌面</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>FreezeDesktop</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>桌面模糊透明度（%）</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>DesktopBlurTransparency</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>35</integer>
			<key>min</key>
			<integer>0</integer>
			<key>max</key>
			<integer>100</integer>
			<key>showValue</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>截屏隐藏气泡</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>HideInScreenshots</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>常用 App</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>在分屏上方容器显示自选 App。从下往上排列，最下面为第一位；下方容器不重复显示已选 App。未选择时不占空间。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>选择常用 App</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>chooseFavorites</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>诊断</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>调试日志默认关闭。错误仍会记录；开启后写入单个日志文件，约 1 MiB 轮转，最多保留当前和上一份。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>调试日志</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>DebugLogging</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>local.notifybubbles</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
